  "description": "Go Yoon-Oh, who had to give up his soccer career due to an unexpected accident, returns as a coach to help his former team, Wimbledon City FC, win the championship. Then one day, 'monster striker' Moon Tae-Won joins the team, but contrary to expectations, he fails to perform as well as he should and is particularly harsh towards Yoon-Oh. Yoon-Oh, who was trying to help him adjust, hears that Tae-Won's health is not good and visits his house... Tae-Won, who is drunk, throws a tantrum, saying that he thinks he will be good at soccer if they are physically intimate.\n\n *\"If you kiss me, I will win the next game with a multi-goal score.\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
